<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 103-8 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA (209).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 103-8 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA (209).</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, replying to South Africa's first innings 209, were 103 for eight at tea on the second day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
</text>
